  "renderedHtml": "</div> \n    </div>\n<div id='main' class='all_colors' data-scroll-offset=\"0\">\n<div id=\"av_section_1\" class=\" only-desktop avia-section main_color avia-section-no-padding avia-no-border-styling avia-full-stretch avia-bg-style-scroll  avia-builder-el-0  el_before_av_submenu  avia-builder-el-first   av-minimum-height av-minimum-height-custom container_wrap fullsize\" style=\"background-repeat: no-repeat; background-image: url(\nhttps://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/building-restoration-page-image.jpg); background-attachment: scroll; background-position: center center; \" data-section-bg-repeat=\"stretch\"><div class=\"container\" style=\"height:450px\"></div></div>\n    <div id=\"av_section_mobile\" class=\" only-mobile\"  style=\"max-height:450px; max-width:100%;\"><img src=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/building-restoration-page-image.jpg\"></div>\n<div class='clear'></div>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n<section class=\"row\" id=\"introductionwelcome\" class=\"introductionwelcome\">\n\t<div  id=\"divintroductionThird\" class=\"divsectiontext\" style=\"margin-bottom:0;\">\n\t\t <br class=\"separatorintro\" />\n\t\t\t  <h1>External Restoration by Complete Restoration</h1>\n          <h2>Sympathetic and knowledgeable building facade restoration is a specialised skill encompassing several highly prized trades</h2>\n   <p>From hand-carving stone and the replacement of sections worn away through years of exposure to the elements, to the installation of new timber around long decayed window frames. Metal, brick or stone – whatever the material, time and weather will eventually wear it away. At Complete Restoration we have these highly specialised trades that can bring period beauty back to life.</p>\n       </div> \n    <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n </section>\n    </div>\n        <div id=\"av_section_5\" class=\"avia-section main_color avia-section-small avia-no-border-styling avia-b